{"sections":[{"slug":"Harish-Chandra同构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Harish-Chandra同构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Harish-Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">同构</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Harish-Chandra 同构”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们自由地将</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\mathfrak g^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathfrak b^*\\simeq\\mathfrak b^-$. <span lang=\"zh\">投影</span> $\\mathfrak b\\to\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应于代数的嵌入</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)\\hookrightarrow\\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak b^-)$.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Weyl群","text":"Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $W$ <span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> $N(H)/H$.</p>\n<p>$G$ <span lang=\"zh\">以共轭作用于</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak g)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其不动点</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}^G$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为代数同构于</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)^W$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}